{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\FormsDeck\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "vimeo/psalm is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/CardFactory.php:582 OCP\\Constants::PERMISSION_READ: deprecated since Nextcloud 13; Use \\OCP\\Constants::PERMISSION_READ instead"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 33 to 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Service/CardFactory.php:582 OCP\\Constants::PERMISSION_READ: deprecated since Nextcloud 13; Use \\OCP\\Constants::PERMISSION_READ instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/MappingController.php:224 time()",
        "lib/Service/CardFactory.php:201 time()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 2 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Controller/MappingController.php:224 time()",
        "  lib/Service/CardFactory.php:201 time()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/AdminSettingsController.php:59 setAppValueBool()",
        "lib/Listener/FormSubmittedListener.php:74 getAppValueBool()",
        "lib/Settings/Admin.php:47 getAppValueBool()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The app reads and writes its app config in 3 places and registers no config lexicon, which IRegistrationContext::registerConfigLexicon() takes since Nextcloud 31. A lexicon states the type, the default and the sensitivity of each key in one place.",
        "  lib/Controller/AdminSettingsController.php:59 setAppValueBool()",
        "  lib/Listener/FormSubmittedListener.php:74 getAppValueBool()",
        "  lib/Settings/Admin.php:47 getAppValueBool()"
      ]
    }
  ],
